## Reflection

This project introduced finite state machines, which are one of the most important concepts in digital design.

Unlike previous projects, the behavior of the circuit is described using states and transitions rather than simple combinational or sequential logic.

Designing the traffic light controller helped me understand how digital systems move between different operating modes over time.

## Problems

No major problems occurred during this project.

The main challenge was understanding how each state determines the next state.

